## Stage 6 — simplicity and reuse review

- Finding: The changed MB-06/MB-07, MB-11, N06/N10/S03, and X05 criteria add the selected private VNC channel, bounded cleanup, and geometry evidence without adding a competing runtime or broadening the feature beyond the accepted fixes. `reuse.md` ties existing lifecycle/API/UI behavior to exact FoxProfile seams and records the limits of process-local locks, inherited environment, and the loopback page-control server. The adapter/gateway, authorization, persistent identity, and isolation gaps are stated as custom work; no existing candidate is claimed to supply the absent VNC bridge.
