- Review: read repository instructions, Code Simplifier skill, UA/PA specs, API contract and task 3; inspected protected facade/config/request scope/run contracts, Container adapters, auth/dependencies/MCP, classified profile/browser/page/proxy/admin/managed-transfer routes, schemas and shutdown hooks. No additional blocking ownership, pending-ID, role, CSRF, or path finding. ContextVar restoration, whole-batch preflight, shared catalog lock, live session/grant checks, redacted filtered discovery, and unavailable-runtime fail-closed behavior are explicit. No simplification-only edit warranted. Loopback HTTP exception checks both URL hostname and actual peer: external peer with Host localhost and loopback peer with public hostname each returned 403; only both-loopback HTTP passed. Public HTTPS cookies retain Secure, HttpOnly and SameSite=Strict.
